    "catalogue_description": "Trapped in the realm of Satan, you must endure his wrath!!! ______________________________________ Vindicta Diaboli (Vengeance Of The Devil) This is a hell-themed zombies map that is the successor to Necro Forest with harrybo21\u2019s perks and a buyable ending. Features include: -Hell-ish theme -Harrybo21\u2019s perks (Each player can carry 6 perks) -Buyable ending -Weapons (non-elemental) improved from Necro Forest along with a couple new ones: -Colt M1911 -B23R -Ballista -SMR -M27 -MP7 -Peacekeeper -AN-94 -AK-47 -SCAR-H -Type-25 -.44 Magnum -Skorpion EVO -Chicom CQB -Remington 870MCS -KSG -XPR-50 -MK-48 -Ray Gun -Ray Gun Mark II -Blundergat -Der Riese teleporter system -Easter Egg Song: Hold F on all 3 teddy bears hidden in the map to activate the hidden song! -Known Issues: -There are no teleporter effects (I had to exlude them to avoid the 400fx limit) -Sometimes the mystery box light will disappear. Credits: -Megadeth9811 (Me): Mapping -Harrybo21: Black Ops Perks -BluntStuffy: Raygun Mk2 FX I will do my best to update this map, but for now, here is the initial release:",
